{"unit_id":"wodongx123__dsh-language-control#card-zh","repo":"wodongx123/dsh-language-control","commit":"55c57b301e399e5b4003d35917e492c83a77da8a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-language-control 是面向 DSH Web 的语言控制插件：它在每次系统提示组装时把语言约束放到提示前部，并添加运行时语言提醒，帮助 Agent 在工具返回外语内容后仍按指定语言推理和回答。插件默认要求中文，也允许用户在设置面板编辑约束、启用自定义文本或恢复默认。服务端提供状态读取、更新和重置接口，客户端在设置页提供文本框和开关；适合希望稳定使用中文完成推理与交互的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126-159","lib/client.js:101-203"]}
{"unit_id":"wodongx123__dsh-language-control#card-en","repo":"wodongx123/dsh-language-control","commit":"55c57b301e399e5b4003d35917e492c83a77da8a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-language-control refreshes a language constraint in each DSH Web system prompt. Chinese is the default; users can edit it, enable custom text, or restore the default in a settings panel. A runtime reminder helps the agent retain the chosen language after tools return other-language content.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126-159","lib/client.js:101-203"]}
