{"unit_id":"wodongx123__dsh-language-control#feature-1","repo":"wodongx123/dsh-language-control","commit":"55c57b301e399e5b4003d35917e492c83a77da8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-language-control 的功能「逐步注入语言约束」：在系统提示中注册语言约束段和运行时提醒，约束文本在每次求值时读取；默认内容要求思考、规划、工具推理和回答使用中文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-28","lib/index.js:137-157"]}
